\"bb_paragraph\" >* More than 1000 different units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* More than 500 unique spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* More than 300 magic items.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Design your own God by choosing his physical form, magic skills and how his dominion affects the world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Dominion. Make sure that the dominion of enemy gods doesn't enter and corrupt your lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* The worlds most famous heroes will be granted heroic abilities that grows with their fame.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Mercenaries are bought on a global market, all players can bid, but only one will get them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Build fortresses to protect your lands and to boost your production. Fortresses must be besieged before they can be stormed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Huge automatic battles with hundreds of units.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Much improved user interface compared to Dominions I.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >* Modding is possible.</p>","developers":["Illwinter Game Design"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3533600/header.jpg?t=1742306880","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Any 64-bit linux distro<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 64-bit intel/amd cpu<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Integrated graphics or better<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 300 MB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3533600/834418/f1b8d6ab38d668980